 # cr-jl3b-1: a file in the current folder shadows a saved job of the same name

 **Severity**: MEDIUM (reviewer: MEDIUM)
-**Status**: Open
+**Status**: Fixed — awaiting re-review
 **Branch**: — (default-branch mode; fixes land on master)
-**Commit**: —
